  "description": "RIDE LIGHT, TRAVEL FAR The SX range takes touring by bike to an entirely new level. Thanks to its slim tube profiles and compact downtube-motor interface, the lightweight design is not only visible at first glance but also reflected on the scale. At just 16.7 kg, the lightest model sets a remarkable benchmark. The range includes both carbon and aluminium frame options. Sport stands for on-road trekking and comes fully equipped with high-quality, multifunctional luggage racks, lightweight yet effective fenders, and integrated lighting systems. Cross represents off-road trekking and identifies models designed for riders who occasionally venture beyond paved roads and onto gravel and dirt paths. The proven KTM trekking geometry delivers a confident and enjoyable ride, combining agility and comfort for both everyday use and longer tours. All SX models feature KTM’s innovative POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system for user-friendly battery handling. The CompactTube 400 Wh battery can be conveniently removed upwards from the frame on every model. For extended adventures, KTM offers smart solutions for carrying a second battery, as well as compatibility with the Bosch PowerMore Range Extender (250 Wh), which can be mounted directly to the battery cover on both diamond and trapeze frame models.",
